  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Strenghening Women, Youth and CENI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">This project presents a transformative initiative to establish an inclusive, credible, and equitable electoral process in Madagascar, by addressing immediate barriers to youth&#x2019;s and women&#x2019;s participation while tackling systemic inequities. It will also strengthen the institutional capacities of the electoral management body (CENI) by providing high technology equipment to manage a biometric electoral register database. The project strives to address these systemic obstacles and to foster sustain</narrative>
  </description>
